{
  "name": "id-collision",
  "domain": "project-management",
  "format": "task-graph",
  "description": "同一个任务 ID 被两张不同的图声明（storage-plan 与 legacy-import 都叫 T4）。重复 ID 让「T4→T6 这条边」失去指向 —— 关于它的任何结论都无法被重算。这类缺陷的优先级高于它引起的任何具体问题，因为它是「锚点不可重算」本身。",
  "input": {
    "format": "task-graph",
    "payload": {
      "documents": [
        {
          "path": "project/storage-plan.json",
          "type": "task-graph",
          "meta": {
            "bytes": 2048
          },
          "payload": {
            "tasks": [
              {
                "id": "T4",
                "title": "对象存储选型",
                "owner": "alice",
                "estimateDays": 2,
                "status": "todo",
                "team": "storage"
              },
              {
                "id": "T6",
                "title": "冷热分层策略",
                "owner": "alice",
                "estimateDays": 4,
                "status": "todo",
                "team": "storage",
                "dependsOn": [
                  "T4"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "path": "project/legacy-import.json",
          "type": "task-graph",
          "meta": {
            "bytes": 1024
          },
          "payload": {
            "tasks": [
              {
                "id": "T4",
                "title": "旧系统迁移清单（同名 ID，不同东西）",
                "owner": "bob",
                "estimateDays": 5,
                "status": "todo",
                "team": "migration"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "expect": {
    "candidates": 4,
    "paths": [
      "project/storage-plan-t6-t4.json",
      "project/storage-plan-task-t4.json",
      "project/storage-plan-task-t6.json",
      "project/legacy-import-task-t4.json"
    ],
    "admitted": 4,
    "excludedByPredicate": {
      "binary": [],
      "secret": [],
      "deleted": [],
      "user-exclude": [],
      "extension": [],
      "default-path": [],
      "too-large": []
    },
    "bounded": true,
    "truncated": false,
    "bundleKeys": [
      "ws/migration",
      "ws/storage"
    ]
  },
  "anchors": {
    "positive": [
      {
        "note": "单图内的边仍然可以重算 —— ID 冲突只在跨图时发生，验证器必须能区分「这张图内部自洽」与「整个语料不自洽」。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/storage-plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "task-edge",
            "from": "T6",
            "to": "T4"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/storage-plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/storage-plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T4"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "T6",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T4"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "declared-locator",
        "expectPath": "project/storage-plan.json"
      }
    ],
    "negative": [
      {
        "note": "方向与存在性都由引擎重算：storage-plan 里真实存在的是 T6 → T4，声明写成 T4 → T6 就是反向边，必须判矛盾。这条负例证明「图会让模型说错方向」，紧接着的探针证明「同一 ID 出现在两张图里时，连方向问题都不该回答」。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/storage-plan.json",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "task-edge",
            "from": "T4",
            "to": "T6"
          }
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "project/storage-plan.json",
          "documents": [
            {
              "path": "project/storage-plan.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T4"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "T6",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T4"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "path": "project/legacy-import.json",
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T4",
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T6"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "T6"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "locator-mismatch",
        "expectAmbiguousIn": [
          "project/legacy-import.json#T4",
          "project/storage-plan.json#T4"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "ambiguous": [
      {
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "relocation-ambiguous",
        "claim": {
          "locator": {
            "to": "T4",
            "kind": "task-edge",
            "from": "T6"
          },
          "kind": "task-and-edge",
          "path": "project/unknown.json"
        },
        "note": "声明的图不在语料里，而 T6 → T4 这条边在两张图里都成立 —— 搬迁不唯一，必须拒绝并列出两个落点。注意 T4、T6 这两个 id 同时出现在两张图里本身不是拒绝的理由（每个团队的 plan 都有自己的 T1）；决定因素是「声明在几张图里成立」。",
        "expectAmbiguousIn": [
          "project/legacy-import.json#task-edge",
          "project/storage-plan.json#task-edge"
        ],
        "subject": {
          "documents": [
            {
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T4"
                  },
                  {
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T4"
                    ],
                    "id": "T6"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "path": "project/storage-plan.json"
            },
            {
              "payload": {
                "tasks": [
                  {
                    "id": "T4"
                  },
                  {
                    "dependsOn": [
                      "T4"
                    ],
                    "id": "T6"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "path": "project/legacy-import.json"
            }
          ],
          "path": "project/unknown.json"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}